<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<title>FAQ | HeartCode Admin</title>
</head>
<body data-page="faq">
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('../partials/nav', { activePage: 'faq' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <section class="admin-page-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="admin-eyebrow">Content</p>
        <h1>FAQ</h1>
        <p>Questions and answers shown in the homepage's FAQ section, and in the FAQPage structured data search engines read from the same content.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-page-actions"><a href="/<%= slug %>/landing-sections" class="admin-btn-outline">Homepage sections</a></div>
    </section>

    <div class="admin-callout">
      Entries here have no effect until an &ldquo;FAQ&rdquo; section exists and is active on the <a href="/<%= slug %>/landing-sections">Landing Sections</a> page.
      An inactive entry is hidden from both the visible section and the structured data.
    </div>

    <section class="admin-split-grid">
      <div class="admin-card admin-sticky-card">
        <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Create</p><h2>Add question</h2></div></div>
        <form id="addFaqForm">
          <label class="admin-label" for="faqQuestion">Question</label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="question" id="faqQuestion" required placeholder="e.g. How long does it take to get my site?">
          <label class="admin-label" for="faqAnswer">Answer</label>
          <textarea class="admin-textarea" name="answer" id="faqAnswer" required placeholder="Shown when the question is expanded"></textarea>
          <div class="admin-form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="admin-btn">Add question</button>
            <p id="addFaqStatus" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="admin-list-panel">
        <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Published order</p><h2>Questions</h2></div></div>
        <div id="faqList" class="admin-entry-list"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
